ally UTC, it falls between them at 10:05. If it's local time in some other zone, it could be off by whole hours. I can't tell which from the file alone.\n\nYou'll need to find out what timezone the source system used for row 2. After that, you could add an explicit offset to it, or normalize the whole column to UTC.", "commits": [], "branch": "main", "before": {}, "after": {}}}